  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), GNX SEM seen from above, front (MODE / C1 / gear lever edge) at the bottom, every control and its printed label visible",
  "mappingSource": "MobiFlight vkbsim_nxt_sem.joystick.json (https://github.com/MobiFlight/MobiFlight-Connector/blob/main/src/MobiFlightConnector/Joysticks/vkbsim/vkbsim_nxt_sem.joystick.json: 1 A1, 2 A2, 3-5 B1-B3, 6-8 Sw1 up/centre/down, 9-11 Sw2 up/centre/down, 12 Start, 13-16 Mode 1-4, 17 C1, 18-21 Flaps 3/2/1/0, 22-24 Gear down/neutral/up) as cited by the catalog - checked, the catalog matches it; control names and places from VKB's binding template \"VKB Side Extension Module SEM\" v1.0 by UntoldForce (https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0808/7827/2731/files/VKB-SEM-v1.0.pdf, linked on https://vkbsimcontrollers.com/pages/downloads) - labels only, no button numbers",
  "confidence": "high",
  "note": "numbering is for the SEM on its own USB link (231D:2204); chained behind a Gladiator stick every SEM button moves up by 40 (catalog identify.note). the flaps lever carries four parts here (lever positions down/mid/up, \"FLAPS 2\" = the 4th detent JOY_BTN19 that the catalog keeps as panel.selector.2, and the flaps axis); the gear lever carries three (up/down, neutral = panel.button.8, gear axis). The markers are stacked on each lever. Catalog naming: flaps lever \"down\" = MobiFlight \"Flaps 3\", \"mid\" = \"Flaps 1\", \"up\" = \"Flaps 0\" - consistent, only the 2nd detent sits in a separate part. the two lever axes have no input ids in the catalog (VKB template lists axes Flaps and Gear); placed for later bindings.",
